## 6.1 The central finding: the ranking contradicts its own table

001A publishes an ordinal list of twenty opportunities and, separately, a
seven-row scoring table. The two do not agree.

To test this, the reviewer applied the simplest defensible composite to 001A's
own numbers, treating the three cost dimensions as costs:

