| Opportunity | 90d | Align | LT | Diff | TTC | Cap | Composite | Implied rank | **001A published rank** |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Cybersecurity Audits | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 2 | 1 | **8** | 1 (tie) | 3 |
| AI Workshops/Training | 4 | 4 | 3 | 1 | 1 | 1 | **8** | 1 (tie) | **9** |
| Enterprise AI Governance | 4 | 5 | 5 | 3 | 3 | 1 | **7** | 3 | 2 |
| Federal AI Governance | 3 | 5 | 5 | 4 | 3 | 2 | **4** | 4 (tie) | **1** |
