policy reversal.

**R15 — Commoditization of the deliverable (Severity: Medium-High).** Policy
frameworks, maturity assessments, and gap analyses are precisely what generative
AI produces most cheaply. QSL's own tooling accelerates the deflation of its own
service prices. Defensibility must therefore rest on accountability,
attestation, independence, and liability-bearing judgement — things a model
cannot supply — rather than on document production.

**R16 — Window risk in both directions (Severity: Medium).** The reports assume
the opportunity persists for the duration of a slow institutional build. Either
the market matures and consolidates around credentialed incumbents before QSL
establishes position, or it cools. Slow strategies have exposure at both ends.
